Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] A guest part's return is said as weighed before its
 season, not at the renewal

The producers weigh a guest part six weeks before a season ordered or renewed, since the invitation moved from the
network's word to the wrap; the record's, the decider's and INVITE's comments still said "at the network's renewal". And
the guide's own line that a renewed series' part "comes only through its option or a new casting" stopped being true
the day a guest part could be asked back, so it says the third way now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HBdcuKzBBMbipfFQSByALG
